==Finnish==
[[File:Reindeer (51600641522).jpg|thumb]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*pëtra}}. Cognates include dialectal {{cog|fi|petra}}, {{cog|et|põder}} and {{cog|vep|pedr}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# a [[reindeer]] or a [[caribou]], a general term used to refer to the deer species {{taxfmt|Rangifer tarandus|species}} and its twelve subspecies
# {{ellipsis of|fi|metsäpeura||Finnish forest reindeer ({{taxfmt|Rangifer tarandus fennicus|subspecies}})}}
# [[telemetacarpal deer]] {{gloss|any species of subfamily {{taxfmt|Capreolinae|subfamily}}}}
# any medium-sized [[deer]] of unspecified species

